%N A361288 Number of free polyominoes of size 2*n for which there exists at least one closed path that passes through each square exactly once.
%C A361288 A polyomino for which more than one closed path exists counts as 1. On the other hand, in A266549, distinct closed paths count separately. For example for n=7, this latter sequence distinguishes between
